# Motorhead cine v1
# Classic <-> Remaster inside one video (#427): RedRock, 8 AI cars, 10 s from the green light.
# Shots 0-3 s draw like the render (Classic with --classic), then Remaster, back to Classic on the nose camera
# (a hard cut), and a 0.5 s dissolve from the Classic nose into a Remaster chase.
Race Track 1 Cars 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Difficulty medium Laps 3 Catchup on Start go
Output Size 1920 1080 Fps 60
End 10

Camera grid    static  Eye 14 3 -10 Target car 7 Zoom auto 18 Lag 0.15 Lead 0.2 Clear on
Camera gantry  static  Eye -6 7 80 Target leader Zoom auto 30 Lag 0.25 Lead 0.3 Clear on
Camera nose    mounted Target leader Offset 0 0.55 2.1 Angles 0 0 0 Zoom 1 Hide on
Camera chase   chase   Target car 3

Shot 0 grid
Shot 3 gantry Mode remaster
Shot 6 nose Mode classic
Shot 8 chase Mode remaster Dissolve 0.5
